# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outSet is project
outSet purpose "An audit program just outside the stage0 subset, which refined accepts; stage0 refuses it"
outSet target console
outSet version "0.1.0"
outSet language refined 1
outSet standardLibrary 1
outSet allows write console.stdout none
outSet requires none
outSet includesModule outSet
outSet entry outSet.main
